  "id": "6a2b973b-5723-4542-986c-7bf2093ffa4b",
  "title": "Unified 3D Gaussian Splatting Frameworks for Realistic Scene Reconstruction",
  "summary": "RealityBridge and CRP-GS introduce advanced methods for 3DGS that address challenges in sparse view synthesis, while LG-HCC improves compression efficiency. OctreeSplat and SplatFlux combine video and 3D models for realistic scene reconstruction, with OctreeSplat focusing on spatially varying Gaussian primitives. X-Gaussian and SAR-NeRF provide efficient and accurate 3D reconstruction methods for X-ray applications.",
